# Operator notes (local only)

Copy this file to `docs/OPERATOR_NOTES.md`. That copy is gitignored.

Do not commit real script IDs, spreadsheet IDs, deployment IDs, personal emails, tax IDs, bank details, or filing numbers.

## Apps Script

- scriptId: YOUR_SCRIPT_ID
- parentId (test spreadsheet): YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID
- Marketplace deployment ID: YOUR_DEPLOYMENT_ID

## Accounts

- Google account that owns the Cloud project: you@example.com
- Cloudflare account: the account that owns rowvoice.com (see `account_id` in the wrangler configs)
- GCP project number: YOUR_GCP_PROJECT_NUMBER

## Business records

Keep EIN letters, trade-name filings, and bank details outside this repository.
